WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.899
Just like happy, our good things can change us, bad things can too.

00:00:03.899 --> 00:00:07.799
Touching a hot stove and getting burned teaches us to stay away from it.

00:00:07.799 --> 00:00:11.200
Playing a boring game helps us learn not to play it again.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:16.199
Sometimes people fight with family or friends, and that can really change how we feel.

00:00:16.199 --> 00:00:19.800
It's good to learn from bad things so we don't make the same mistakes again,

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:25.600
but sometimes too many bad things can start to change the way we think and feel.

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:29.800
For example, if you burn your hand, you'll probably be more careful around the stove

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:31.300
and stay back when it's hot.

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:34.799
That's smart, but if you always stay away from the stove,

00:00:34.799 --> 00:00:38.200
it might be hard to cook when you're older and have to make your own food.

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:40.399
That's how bad things can affect us.

00:00:40.399 --> 00:00:46.200
At first, we do things to keep ourselves safe, but later, those things might not help us anymore.

